    1517,
    399
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of Libra, Mars of Scorpio, Jupiter of Sagittarius, Saturn of",
   "bbox": [
    302,
    395,
    1521,
    451
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Capricorn, Saturn again of Acquarius and Jupiter of Pisces.",
   "bbox": [
    302,
    446,
    1516,
    505
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The Navamsa (1/9th part of sign) lords in the signs follow the",
   "bbox": [
