   "text": "on. Thus the first Navamsas in the signs Aries, Cancer, Libra",
   "bbox": [
    304,
    922,
    1521,
    976
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and Capricorn will belong to Aries Cancer, Libra and Capri-",
